# 2. Pinned model versions get retired for NEW projects. `gemini-2.5-flash` returns
#    404 "no longer available to new users" on a project created today, while still
#    being listed by /v1beta/models — listing is not usability. The code therefore
#    defaults to the `gemini-flash-latest` alias. Override with GEMINI_MODEL if you
#    need a specific version.
